        "created_at": "2013-03-24T07:05:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The moment you need to draw, play, or discard from a deck without cards, you reshuffle the discard pile.&nbsp; (Note: revealing cards from a deck does not cause it to shuffle)</p>",
