        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-24T16:04:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Correct. &nbsp;As Dypaca mentioned, the act of <em>needing</em> to draw, play, or discard from a deck without cards is what makes you reshuffle. &nbsp;It's OK to sit there with no deck and a full trash if you don't actually need to do one of those things yet.</p>",
