        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-24T16:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If a card says MAY draw, you chose, if a card forces a draw you reshuffle and then draw. (End of turn draws are \"you MAY\" draws)</p><p>If an effect forces you to play a card and/or discard cards from the top of your deck and you have no cards in your deck... actually I'm not sure what happens then.</p>",
