        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-24T19:43:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah - drawing and discarding means you ned to shuffle. If you need to reveal, you don't shuffle so if something tells you to reveal cards and the deck is empty, you reveal nothing. LIkewise, if you need to reveal a certain number of cards (eg Arcane Cadence) but there aren't that many cards there, you only reveal as many as are left and lose out on the rest.</p>",
